<article class="legal-page"><header><p class="eyebrow">Customer care</p><h1>{{ six_faq_title }}</h1></header><div class="faq-list"><details open><summary>How do I choose a ring size?</summary><p>Use an existing ring that fits the intended finger or book a private sizing consultation. Fingers can vary between hands and throughout the day.</p></details><details><summary>Are your diamonds certified?</summary><p>Independent certificates are available for selected signature stones. The product page and atelier confirm the certificate supplied with each piece.</p></details><details id="care"><summary>How should I care for fine jewelry?</summary><p>Store pieces separately, avoid chemicals and remove jewelry for sport or household work. Clean gently with warm water and a soft brush.</p></details><details id="size"><summary>Can a ring be resized?</summary><p>Many designs can be resized, but pavé, eternity and highly structured pieces can have limitations. Ask the atelier before ordering.</p></details></div></article>
